# ─── AI tool session directories (local to each tool, not for collaboration) ───


# ─── Package manager caches and redundant lock files ───────────────────────────
# bun.lock is the canonical lockfile (packageManager: bun). Ignore artifacts from
# other package managers so a stray `npm install` / `yarn` / `pnpm install` can't
# sneak a second lockfile into the repo.
bun_cache/
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml
bun.lockb

